  "body": "Closes #626.\n\nFeedback welcome on the design here, and on the usage of a GitHub wiki page, and more. Open to changes. I just wanted to get something started.\n\nPotential styles you might want to try to make the headers look nicer, by using devtools to tweak the CSS:\n\n``` css\n#head nav > div {\n  display: inline; // instead of inline-block\n}\n\n#head nav > div > a {\n  width: 190px;\n}\n```\n\nAs-is is OK too though.\n",
